  "Graph API 버전 (기본 {DEFAULT_GRAPH_VERSION})": "Graph API version (default {DEFAULT_GRAPH_VERSION})",
  "Instagram · Facebook — 내 Meta 앱 만들기 (BYO, 두 플랫폼 공용)\n\n앱에 역할(관리자·개발자·테스터)이 있는 사용자는 App Review 없이 Standard Access로 게시할 수 있습니다.\n\n1. https://developers.facebook.com/apps 에서 앱 생성 (유형: Business)\n2. 제품 추가: \"Facebook 로그인(비즈니스용)\", \"Instagram Graph API\"\n3. Instagram은 프로페셔널(비즈니스/크리에이터) 계정이어야 하고 Facebook 페이지에 연결돼 있어야 합니다\n   Facebook Reels는 개인 프로필이 아니라 페이지에만 올릴 수 있습니다\n4. fanout app set meta --appId <ID> --appSecret <SECRET>\n5. Graph API 탐색기(https://developers.facebook.com/tools/explorer/)에서 내 앱을 고르고\n   권한 pages_show_list, pages_read_engagement, pages_manage_posts,\n   instagram_basic, instagram_content_publish, business_management 를 선택해 \"Generate Access Token\"\n   (댓글 모아보기·Instagram 답글: instagram_manage_comments, Facebook 답글: pages_manage_engagement,\n    조회수: Instagram은 instagram_manage_insights, Facebook은 read_insights 도 선택)\n6. 그 토큰으로 연결 (장기 토큰으로 바꾼 뒤, 만료되지 않는 페이지 토큰을 저장합니다):\n     fanout connect instagram --name main [--page <페이지 ID>]\n     fanout connect facebook  --name main [--page <페이지 ID>]\n7. fanout doctor instagram 으로 오늘 남은 게시 한도를 확인\n\n⚠ 공식 문서에 Instagram 하루 한도가 100건과 50건으로 엇갈려 있어, fanout은 매번\n   content_publishing_limit를 직접 조회합니다.": "Instagram · Facebook — create your own Meta app (BYO, shared by both)\n\nUsers with a role on the app (admin, developer, tester) can post with Standard Access, without App Review.\n\n1. Create an app at https://developers.facebook.com/apps (type: Business)\n2. Add products: \"Facebook Login for Business\" and \"Instagram Graph API\"\n3. Instagram needs a professional (business/creator) account linked to a Facebook Page\n   Facebook Reels can only go to Pages, not personal profiles\n4. fanout app set meta --appId <ID> --appSecret <SECRET>\n5. In the Graph API Explorer (https://developers.facebook.com/tools/explorer/) pick your app,\n   select the permissions pages_show_list, pages_read_engagement, pages_manage_posts,\n   instagram_basic, instagram_content_publish, business_management and \"Generate Access Token\"\n   (comments and Instagram replies: also instagram_manage_comments; Facebook replies: pages_manage_engagement;\n    views: instagram_manage_insights for Instagram, read_insights for Facebook)\n6. Connect with that token (it is exchanged for a long-lived one, and a non-expiring Page token is kept):\n     fanout connect instagram --name main [--page <Page ID>]\n     fanout connect facebook  --name main [--page <Page ID>]\n7. fanout doctor instagram shows how many posts are left today\n\n⚠ The official docs give both 100 and 50 as Instagram's daily limit, so fanout reads\n   content_publishing_limit every time.",
