  "X — 내 X 개발자 앱 만들기 (BYO, 유료)\n\nX API는 종량제입니다(게시 1건 약 $0.015, URL이 들어가면 약 $0.20 — 2026년 기준). 크레딧을 먼저 충전하세요.\n\n1. https://console.x.com/ 에서 앱 생성\n2. User authentication settings: OAuth 2.0 켜기, 앱 유형 \"Native App\"(public) 또는 \"Web App\"(confidential)\n   권한: Read and write\n3. Callback URI에 둘 다 등록:\n     대시보드: http://127.0.0.1:8780/oauth/x/callback\n     CLI:      {DEFAULT_REDIRECT}\n4. fanout app set x --clientId <ID> [--clientSecret <SECRET>]\n5. fanout connect x --name main   (또는 대시보드 설정 탭)\n6. fanout doctor x\n\n요청 범위: {SCOPES}": "X — create your own X developer app (BYO, paid)\n\nThe X API is pay-per-use (about $0.015 per post, about $0.20 with a URL — as of 2026). Top up credits first.\n\n1. Create an app at https://console.x.com/\n2. User authentication settings: turn on OAuth 2.0, app type \"Native App\" (public) or \"Web App\" (confidential)\n   Permissions: Read and write\n3. Register both callback URIs:\n     dashboard: http://127.0.0.1:8780/oauth/x/callback\n     CLI:       {DEFAULT_REDIRECT}\n4. fanout app set x --clientId <ID> [--clientSecret <SECRET>]\n5. fanout connect x --name main   (or the dashboard settings tab)\n6. fanout doctor x\n\nScopes requested: {SCOPES}",
  "브라우저에서 X에 로그인하고 권한을 승인하세요:\n{url}": "Sign in to X in the browser and approve the permissions:\n{url}",
  "X 토큰이 만료됐습니다 — 다시 연결하세요": "The X token expired — reconnect",
  "X 글이 {len}(가중치) / {TEXT_MAX}입니다. Premium이 아니면 거부됩니다 — options.text로 줄이세요": "The X post is {len} (weighted) / {TEXT_MAX}. Without Premium it is refused — shorten it with options.text",
  "X는 URL이 들어간 게시물 요금이 훨씬 비쌉니다(약 $0.20)": "On X, posts with a URL cost much more (about $0.20)",
  "X는 API 예약 게시가 없어 fanout이 예약 시각에 올립니다 (fanout worker 필요)": "X has no API scheduling, so fanout posts at the scheduled time (needs fanout running)",
